ovisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003:m0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"王緯","kind":"person","person_id":"6zl_pbb_92e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003:m0224","start":224,"end":225,"surface":"放","kind":"person","person_id":"axs_5y7_p7w_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003:m0253","start":253,"end":255,"surface":"李獎","kind":"person","person_id":"6zc_8qd_8zj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003:m0256","start":256,"end":258,"surface":"費穆","kind":"person","person_id":"9ja_5u9_4of","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003:m0283","start":283,"end":284,"surface":"穆","kind":"person","person_id":"9ja_5u9_4of","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete:p003:m0288","start":288,"end":290,"surface":"王緯","kind":"person","person_id":"6zl_pbb_92e","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-weifang-complete","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-weifang-complete-ws1511902"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-xiaoxu-complete:p002","text":"續少英果，膂力絕人，馳射游獵，應發命中。高祖常歎曰：「此我之任城也。」嘗與臨賀王正德及胡貴通、趙伯超等馳射于高祖前，續冠于諸人，高祖大悅。三年，爲使持節、都督雍、梁、秦、沙四州諸軍事、西中郎將、雍州刺史。七年，加宣毅將軍。中大通二年，又爲使持節、都督雍、梁、秦、沙四州諸軍事、平北將軍、寧蠻校尉、雍州刺史，給鼓吹一部。續多聚馬仗，畜養驍雄，金帛內盈，倉廩外實。四年，遷安北將軍。大同元年，爲使持節、都督江州諸軍事、安南將軍、江州刺史。三年，徵爲護軍將軍、領石頭戍軍事。五年，爲驃騎將軍、開府儀同三司。又出爲使持節、都督荊郢司雍南北秦梁巴華九州諸軍事、荊州刺史。中大同二年，薨於州，時年四十四。贈司空、散騎常侍、驃騎大將軍，鼓吹一部，諡曰威。長子安嗣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":35,"last_line":35,"raw_start":2066,"raw_end":2412,"raw_character_offsets":[2066,2067,2068,2069,2070,2071,2072,2073,2074,2075,2076,2077,2078,2079,2080,2081,2082,2083,2084,2085,2086,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099,2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,21